# U-SCRIPT V6.52 - U-PANEL - OBFUSCATED
# V6.20 FIX (25 Nov): the old wrapper extracted to mktemp (/tmp/tmp.XXXX) and
# deleted it after the extracted script exited - but the Panel server daemonizes
# (nohup) and keeps running, so every later job ran "sh <deleted file>" ->
# "No such file or directory" + [EXIT 127]. Now the payload lives at a STABLE
# path /tmp/U-Panel.sh that is NEVER deleted - the server U_PANEL_PATH and
# find_script() both resolve to it, so jobs keep working after the menu exits.
# V6.52: POST /login with a correct PIN no longer shows the "Welcome / Open
# Panel" page - it sends a 302 redirect straight to / (the menus) with the
# same upanel_pin cookie. Wrong PIN still shows "Wrong PIN / Try again".
# V6.51: Live TV logic ported from V4.99 (defaults player, old unstick, no
# auto-reconnect). V6.50: menu arrows removed.
